{title: Tera Chehra}
{artist: Adnan Sami}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A]yeh zameen [G]ruk jaaye,
[A]aasman [G]jhuk jaaye
[F]tera [G]chehra jab [A]nazar aaye
[A]Na na [G]na na [F]na na...
[G]Na na na [A]na na na...
[A]tu ijaazat de agar
[A]tujh se thora [G]pyar main kar loon,
[A]jaan-e-jaan
[A]beth mere saamne
[A]khaali dil khaali [G]nazar bhar loon,
[A]jaan-e-jaan
[A]tu khafa [G]ho jaaye,
[A]raat abhi [G]ho jayee
[F]din tere [G]aanchal mein [A]chup jaaye
[A]tu agar kehde mujhe
[A]chaand bhi [G]le aa-oon jaan-e-jaan,
[A]jaan-e-jaan
[A]ek taara mang le
[A]aasman le [G]aa-oon jaan-e-jaan,
[A]jaan-e-jaan
[A]raat tu [G]jab aaye,
[A]neend bhi [G]le jaaye
[F]khaabon ke [G]jungle me [A]chup jaaye
